    imageWidth: 1536,
    imageHeight: 1024,
    content: "<h3><strong>Where Location Meets Lifestyle</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Positioned in Sector 58 along the prestigious Golf Course Extension Road, the project enjoys one of the most desirable addresses in Gurugram. This corridor has evolved into a premium residential hub, offering seamless connectivity to business districts, entertainment zones, and essential infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p>Whether it’s daily commuting or weekend leisure, everything is within effortless reach. This strategic location not only enhances convenience but also strengthens the project’s long-term investment appeal.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Architecture That Speaks Luxury</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Oberoi Three Sixty North is designed with a clear vision—to create spaces that feel expansive, elegant, and future-ready. The residences reflect a perfect balance of aesthetics and functionality.</p>\r\n<p>Expect:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Open layouts that maximize usable space</li>\r\n<li>Floor-to-ceiling windows inviting natural light</li>\r\n<li>Premium finishes that elevate everyday living</li>\r\n<li>Private balconies offering panoramic city views</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Every detail is thoughtfully curated to deliver a refined living experience that stands apart in Gurgaon’s luxury housing segment.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>A Lifestyle Curated for the Modern Urban Buyer</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Luxury today is defined by experiences, not just square footage. This project delivers a complete ecosystem where residents can unwind, socialize, and rejuvenate without stepping out.</p>\r\n<p>From wellness zones to leisure spaces, the development is expected to offer:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A grand clubhouse for social gatherings</li>\r\n<li>Fitness and wellness facilities for a healthy lifestyle</li>\r\n<li>Landscaped greens that bring nature closer to home</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive spaces for recreation and relaxation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This integrated lifestyle approach makes it ideal for families, professionals, and global investors alike.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Investment That Goes Beyond Numbers</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Real estate in Gurugram has consistently attracted high-value investments, especially in the luxury segment. What makes this project particularly compelling is the combination of brand credibility and location advantage.</p>\r\n<p>Backed by Oberoi Realty, known for its quality and timely delivery, the project offers:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Strong potential for capital appreciation</li>\r\n<li>High rental demand in a premium micro-market</li>\r\n<li>Long-term asset security</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>For investors, it’s not just about buying property—it’s about owning a future-ready asset in one of NCR’s fastest-growing corridors.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Designed for a Sustainable Tomorrow</strong></h3>\r\n<p>Modern homeowners are increasingly conscious about sustainability, and this development aligns with that mindset. With eco-friendly planning and efficient resource management, it ensures a greener way of living.</p>\r\n<p>Expect features like:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Energy-efficient systems</li>\r\n<li>Water-saving technologies</li>\r\n<li>Green landscapes and open spaces</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Such elements not only reduce environmental impact but also enhance the overall quality of life.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>The Rise of a New Landmark</strong></h3>\r\n<p>What truly sets Oberoi Three Sixty North apart is its ability to combine location, luxury, and lifestyle into one seamless offering. It reflects the aspirations of a new generation of homebuyers who value design, connectivity, and exclusivity.</p>\r\n<p>As Gurgaon continues to grow into a global city, developments like this are shaping its identity—one iconic address at a time.</p>\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n<p>If you’re looking for a residence that blends elegance with practicality, or an investment that promises long-term growth, Oberoi Three Sixty North stands out as a compelling choice. It is not just another project—it is a symbol of elevated living in modern Gurgaon.</p>",
