    slug: "sales-value-up-379-in-a-year-why-golf-course-extension-road-is-emerging-as-ncr-s",
    title: "Sales value up 379% in a year: Why Golf Course Extension Road is emerging as NCR’s key micro market",
    date: "April 22, 2026",
    excerpt: "The weighted average property prices in the area also saw a sharp increase — rising from Rs 24,855 per sq ft to Rs 37,899 per sq ft, the report released in March highlights.",
    image: "/images/blog/1776839177-ren-1750220953852-1771847273924.avif",
    imageWidth: 600,
    imageHeight: 337,
    content: "<p>Golf Course Extension Road (GCER) in Gurugram is rapidly transforming into one of the most important real estate micro-markets in the NCR.</p>\r\n<p>Once seen as a peripheral stretch, it is now witnessing explosive growth driven by infrastructure, luxury housing demand, and strong investor interest.</p>\r\n<h3>Massive Surge in Property Value</h3>\r\n<p>The area has recorded an extraordinary rise in transaction activity, with total sales value jumping by around <strong>379% year-on-year</strong>. This sharp increase reflects growing confidence among both homebuyers and investors.</p>\r\n<p>Property prices have also surged significantly, with average rates climbing steeply over the past few years. Launch prices have more than doubled since 2019, showing sustained appreciation.</p>\r\n<h3>Shift from Golf Course Road</h3>\r\n<p>As prime areas like Golf Course Road have become saturated and expensive, demand has naturally shifted toward GCER. Buyers and developers are now focusing on this extension due to <strong>better availability of land and newer developments</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3>Strong Presence of Premium Developers</h3>\r\n<p>Leading real estate players such as M3M, Godrej, and Oberoi have acquired large land parcels here. Their presence has accelerated the development of <strong>luxury and ultra-luxury residential projects</strong>, attracting high-net-worth individuals and NRIs.</p>\r\n<h3>Infrastructure &amp; Connectivity Advantage</h3>\r\n<p>GCER benefits from excellent connectivity:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Links key hubs like Sohna Road and Golf Course Road</li>\r\n<li>Close to major employment centres and business districts</li>\r\n<li>Easy access to Delhi and IGI Airport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>This strategic location makes it highly attractive for professionals working in corporate hubs.</p>\r\n<h3>Rising Demand for Luxury Living</h3>\r\n<p>The micro-market is witnessing a surge in demand for premium homes with modern amenities, wellness features, and gated communities. Buyers today are prioritising <strong>lifestyle-driven housing</strong>, not just location.</p>\r\n<h3>Investor Hotspot with High Growth Potential</h3>\r\n<p>With ongoing infrastructure upgrades and increasing residential and commercial development, GCER offers strong potential for long-term capital appreciation. Experts believe early investment here could yield significant returns as the area continues to mature.</p>\r\n<h2>Bottom Line</h2>\r\n<p>Golf Course Extension Road is no longer an “emerging” location—it is becoming <strong>Gurugram’s next premium real estate hub</strong>, driven by luxury demand, infrastructure growth, and strong price appreciation.</p>\r\n<p>Source : <a href=\"https://indianexpress.com/article/cities/delhi/why-golf-course-extension-road-is-emerging-as-ncrs-key-micro-market-10619829/\">https://indianexpress.com/article/cities/delhi/why-golf-course-extension-road-is-emerging-as-ncrs-key-micro-market-10619829/</a></p>",
