    title: "Krisumi to invest ₹4,500 crore more in Gurugram luxury housing project over next 6–7 years",
    date: "April 21, 2026",
    excerpt: "Krisumi Corporation Ltd, a joint venture between Japan’s Sumitomo Corporation and India’s Krishna Group.",
